  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1>\n<p>TZP Extra Mod Compat добавляет новые текстуры для мобов (зомби), чтобы они больше соответствовали стилю <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-20\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tissou's Zombie Pack</a>&nbsp;.</p>\n<h3><strong>Совместимость с модами:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sullys-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sully's Mod</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mo-zombies-wave\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mo' Zombies Wave</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-variants\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mob Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majruszs-progressive-difficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>До (слева), после (справа)</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c4dc9b77daa13ba0b3c5b2d8bd362210a05fcd28.png\" alt=\"a\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c05f2ef14efa77a9fd6e7f326c6d5bbfabd7e1e6.png\" alt=\"b\"></p>",
